  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/564ba4f5050a8cc33f0ca973a1302fcb.gif\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><h3>这个材质包最初来自我的整合包 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252freimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Reimagined</a>，但我觉得有些人可能只喜欢这个材质而不喜欢我的整合包，所以我决定把它独立出来！</h3><p>你是否也觉得奇怪，Minecraft里最原始的荒野居然总是长着修剪整齐的草坪？这个材质包就是为此而生的！使用本材质后，草方块上会自然生长出柔和的短草，为自然景观增添更多活力、茂盛与野性气息！</p><p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/f3f4039af982436919e3496a63f7c9e6.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><h2>你需要 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fphoton-shader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">光影</a></span> 或 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FabricAPI</a></span> 才能正确显示草！</h2><h3>开箱即用，与其他材质包完全兼容，无论风格如何！</h3><p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/6aac09917b23ddbb5d8ee84c7880d83f.gif\" alt=\"Excalibur\">\n屏幕截图使用了 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fphoton-shader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Photon Shader</a></span> 光影。\n使用的材质包：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252freimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reimagined</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fexcal\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fwhimscape\" rel=\"nofollow\">Whimscape</a>\n<img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/f3f4039af982436919e3496a63f7c9e6.png\" alt=\"分隔线\">\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rstmkrGeFJ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/27c2c5a92a9c063d5d71e74afaabc22d.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n<img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/f3f4039af982436919e3496a63f7c9e6.png\" alt=\"分隔线\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpartners.shockbyte.com%252freimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/5a2618c30403aaceb78a5bceb2b8efd2.png\" alt=\"广告\"></a> 想支持Reimagined吗？通过<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpartners.shockbyte.com%252freimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\">此链接</a>购买，无需额外费用，我将获得部分收益分成</p>",
